create the timer: 0x00000000
the pattern after the create: 0x00000004
open the timer by name: 0x00000000
the wait for the open bit: 0x00000000
the wait for the open bit, the bits it got: 0x00000100
the wait for the open bit: the high word of the user data is the main thread's UID: 0x00000001
the wait for the open bit: the low word of the user data is the process ID: 0x00000001
the pattern after the open: 0x00000104
close the opened UID: 0x00000000
the wait for the close bit: 0x00000000
the wait for the close bit, the bits it got: 0x00000200
the wait for the close bit: the high word of the user data is the main thread's UID: 0x00000001
the wait for the close bit: the low word of the user data is the process ID: 0x00000001
the pattern after the close: 0x00000304
the poll for the close bit: poll for 0x200: 0x00000000
the poll for the close bit: poll for 0x200, the bits it got: 0x00000200
the poll for the close bit: the high word of the user data is the main thread's UID: 0x00000001
the poll for the close bit: the low word of the user data is the process ID: 0x00000001
the poll for the close bit: the pattern after the poll for 0x200: 0x00000304
the poll for the open bit: poll for 0x100: 0x00000000
the poll for the open bit: poll for 0x100, the bits it got: 0x00000100
the poll for the open bit: the high word of the user data is the main thread's UID: 0x00000001
the poll for the open bit: the low word of the user data is the process ID: 0x00000001
the poll for the open bit: the pattern after the poll for 0x100: 0x00000304
